{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261116/photo/bkn-20261116222549783-1116_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261116223145\"/><p>亨泰樓有龜隻從高處墮下死亡。</p><p>今午(16日)4時26分，大埔有途人報案，指在富亨邨亨泰樓對開，一名35厘米長斑龜懷疑從高處墮下。警員接報到場檢獲該隻斑龜，惟牠已經死亡。經初步調查後，案件列作「殘酷對待動物」跟進，該龜屍由愛協人員檢走。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T15:19:40.598548+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T14:25:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T15:53:31.101305+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T15:13:04.552805+00:00","content_hash":"0a3831d7ec445633a489fee615b400ced9e679390f3eba3dc5cb719af9dab608","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}